QUERY PLAN
╭─ IRESEARCH_SCAN ───────╮
│ Index: lep_plain_idx   │
│ Lookup: table          │
│ Index Filter:          │
│ ╭─ Starts With ──────╮ │
│ │ Field: msg(string) │ │
│ │ Prefix: 50%        │ │
│ ╰────────────────────╯ │
│ Projections: id        │
│ ~1 row                 │
╰────────────────────────╯

query
SELECT id FROM lep_plain_idx WHERE msg @@ ts_like('50\%%') ORDER BY id
----
id
1

query
